&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree with a focus in analytics, statistics, economics, finance, marketing, or other quantitative fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in management consulting, strategic data science/analytics roles in a technology company, or an equivalent analytical role in a high growth startup&lt;/li&gt;
