&lt;li&gt;Develop frameworks and scalable processes to drive decision-making and prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the metrics used to measure the success of strategic initiatives and health of our support platform; build dashboards to track metrics over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design A/B tests and execute analyses to evaluate the impact of new product features and operational improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional partners to deliver data-driven insights and actionable recommendations for continuously improving the customer support experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and diagnose KPI performance and present findings to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
