&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate unstructured business problems into clearly defined requirements with minimal oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical skills with the ability to transition between detailed data and high-level business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication (listening, written, and oral) skills with the ability to present findings &amp;amp; recommendations targeted to the audience in question&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills, with the ability to build relationships and trust across functions and work collaboratively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and Python with ability to independently break down large datasets and synthesize inputs from multiple sources&lt;/li&gt;
