&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of clean architecture principles and maintainable code practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in writing robust unit tests using JUnit and Mockito&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with building modern, responsive user interfaces using Jetpack Compose and declarative patterns&lt;/li&gt;
