&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a motivated, technical student to join our Corporate FinTech team as a Business Systems Engineer Intern. This internship offers hands-on experience supporting the full suite of FinTech applications, modernizing finance and business operations through automation, integration, and AI. You&#39;ll work alongside finance, systems, and engineering partners across ERP, HCM, Procurement, Supply Chain, and FP&amp;amp;A to streamline processes, reduce manual work, and build scalable solutions for a public company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some things you&#39;ll gain and learn during this internship include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience across enterprise FinTech applications, including Oracle ERP, Oracle HCM, and Workato&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical exposure to applying AI and RPA to real finance and business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to corporate finance, HR, procurement, supply chain, and FP&amp;amp;A processes at a public company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship from experienced FinTech, automation, and technical professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how system integration and automation drive finance transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cross-functional stakeholders across Finance, HR, Procurement, IT, and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development in agile methodologies and project management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Potential pathway to full-time opportunities within our growing FinTech organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support FinTech applications and processes across Procurement, Supply Chain, and FP&amp;amp;A, including Oracle ERP, Oracle HCM, Jira, and Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain automation workflows using Workato, Python, and related tools under the mentorship of senior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify manual, repetitive processes across finance and business operations and help translate them into automated, well-documented solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write SQL queries to extract, transform, and validate data across source systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data validation and reconciliation processes to ensure accuracy across integrations, reports, and applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and prototype AI-powered solutions using tools such as LangChain, Workato AI, and UiPath&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and maintain Jira automation rules to support intake, tracking, and delivery of FinTech projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in building reports and dashboards that give stakeholders visibility into financial and operational data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in testing of new automations, integrations, configuration changes, and system updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn to gather business requirements from stakeholders and translate them into functional technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide first-level end-user support and troubleshooting across FinTech applications and automated workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in stakeholder meetings, process mapping sessions, and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree at a university in Canada (required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; in Computer Science, Data Engineering, Information Systems, Finance, or a related field,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;with a &lt;strong&gt;graduation date between December 2027 and Summer 2028 (required). &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;For any candidates who are master&#39;s students who worked between their bachelor&#39;s and master&#39;s programs: candidates should also have less than 2 years of relevant full-time work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available during&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Summer 2027 &lt;/strong&gt;for the internship in Toronto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Python for scripting, data manipulation, or automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL for querying and analyzing data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with or strong interest in Workato or similar integration platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with AI frameworks such as LangChain, Workato AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automation tools such as Jira automation, Python scripting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Excel and Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and ability to explain technical concepts to non-technical partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with the ability to learn quickly in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to Haves:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Procurement, Supply Chain, or FP&amp;amp;A processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with business intelligence tools and building reports or dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to data engineering concepts such as data pipelines, data modeling, or ETL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior internship or project experience in automation, data analysis, or business systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
