&lt;li&gt;Own release certification, bug bashes, and the production and management of test artifacts and assets, continuously finding ways to automate and streamline them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Release Management &amp;amp; Production Support
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the release management process, ensuring predictable, high-quality releases across operated and enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the engineering support function, including intake of issues escalated through Zendesk, defect management, root-cause analysis, and resolution of complex production issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn support data into insight, identifying systemic issues and driving fixes with the owning engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
