&lt;p&gt;At Lyft, our purpose is to serve and connect. We aim to achieve this by cultivating a work environment where all team members belong and have the opportunity to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Rider Memberships team is where riders become members. We build the membership, rewards, and benefits products that give people a reason to choose Lyft on every trip, and we make sure the value a rider has earned shows up at the moment it matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will lead an engineering team in close partnership with Product, Design, Data Science, and Partnerships to drive membership retention and continuously innovate on our membership products so riders accrue more value by sticking with Lyft. Additionally, you will lead mobile engineering across our Membership, Partnerships, and Wallet product areas, collaborating closely with fellow Engineering Managers and cross-functional peers to deliver success across our products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
