&lt;li&gt;Oversee mobile engineering across the Membership, Partnerships, and Wallet product areas to ensure cohesive execution and high-quality delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale the systems behind membership, rewards earning and redemption, and benefit delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold a high technical bar through architecture reviews, tech debt management, observability, reliability, and on-call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow engineers by matching people to the right opportunities, setting clear expectations, and giving feedback early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
