&lt;li&gt;Identify and lead internal strategic initiatives to grow the salesforce adoption and return on investment and serve as an active contributor to engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identification and proactive management of risk areas across enterprise and commitment to seeing an issue through to complete resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead assessment of architecture environment and requirements and design sound, scalable, and high-performing solutions on the Salesforce Platform that meet the Single Sign-on (SSO) requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical integration of acquired companies&#39; CRM and GTM systems, including org strategy (consolidate vs. federate), data migration, deduplication and identity resolution, object and picklist harmonization, and decommissioning of legacy orgs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain the multi-org architecture and data model, including cross-org reporting, shared reference data, and territory/hierarchy design that survives each acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
