&lt;p&gt;The TPM in this role will be supporting the Corporate Engineering &amp;amp; IT organization, with a deep focus on sales and financial systems infrastructure and integrations across advertising and B2B organizations. You will collaborate with Finance, Sales, Legal, Engineering, Product, Data Science, Analytics, and Operations on technology programs that help to support our internal Financial priorities to deliver on Lyft company objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
